-- content.rendered (the office's own free-text spec paragraph, e.g. "للبيع ارض في حي الورود
-- الغربي ارض رقم 219 \ ف مساحة 360 م شارع عرض 15 شرقا ... السعر 250,000") was never captured by
-- the scraper — WP REST returns it unconditionally on every post, source_capture only ever stored
-- the ACF block. Re-fetched all 262 residential posts live (reusing the scraper's own session/
-- fetch/clean/redact — no logic duplicated), cleaned of HTML and PII-redacted exactly like the
-- fixed scraper (scrapers/amlakalahsa/run.py) now does going forward, and backfilled here.
